  "ruleText": "Ban 1802.02 Clearing Corporation Location. Trust companies may deposit securities with clearing corporations located outside the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #4083, eff 7-7-86, EXPIRED: 7-7-92\n\nNew. #7486, eff 5-2-01, EXPIRED: 5-2-09\n\nNew. #9755, eff 7-16-10",
